<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse turnover edges up HUF 6.408 bln.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse turnover edges up HUF 6.408 bln.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange's spot share turnover increased to 6.408 billion forints on Tuesday from 6.047 billion on Monday, according to final figures.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsrogm +36 1 327-4040</p>
